@BookStoreAPI_HostAddress = https://localhost:7048

### 1. Get all books
GET {{BookStoreAPI_HostAddress}}/api/books
Accept: application/json

### 2. Filter books by search term
GET {{BookStoreAPI_HostAddress}}/api/books?search=Gatsby
Accept: application/json

### 3. Filter books by Genre (e.g. 0 = Fiction, 4 = ScienceFiction)
GET {{BookStoreAPI_HostAddress}}/api/books?genre=Fiction
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get book by ID
GET {{BookStoreAPI_HostAddress}}/api/books/1
Accept: application/json

### 5. Create a new book (text only, stores text URL/path)
POST {{BookStoreAPI_HostAddress}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookName": "Clean Architecture in .NET",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "genre": 1,
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/clean-arch.jpg"
}

### 6. Update an existing book
PUT {{BookStoreAPI_HostAddress}}/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookName": "The Great Gatsby - Special Edition",
  "author": "F. Scott Fitzgerald",
  "genre": 0,
  "imageUrl": ""
}

### 7. Delete a book by ID
DELETE {{BookStoreAPI_HostAddress}}/api/books/5
Accept: application/json
